  "solution_explanation": [
    "For small angular oscillation, displacement at distance r from hinge is r*theta.",
    "Spring restoring force becomes proportional to r*theta.",
    "Restoring torque is proportional to r^2*theta.",
    "In Fig.1 one spring acts at l and another at l/2.",
    "Total restoring torque constant becomes (5/4)kl^2.",
    "In Fig.2 both springs act at l/2.",
    "Total restoring torque constant becomes (1/2)kl^2.",
    "Angular frequency is proportional to sqrt(C/I).",
    "Taking ratio gives f1/f2 = sqrt(5/2)."
